<item>
<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-10-28T23:22:54.036Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 23:22:54 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen continue to carry out lethal attacks across northern Nigeria, killing civilians in Plateau, shooting Islamic cleric Yahaya Masussuka dead in Katsina, and slaying at least 62 people in Binnari, Taraba, prompting mass displacement. Bandits targeted APC supporters ahead of a rally in Katsina, while kidnappers abducted six residents from the Millennium City estate in Kaduna. Armed escorts of the Nigerian Correctional Service fired warning shots during an assault in Rivers that resulted in one death. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxNaTZHekRTSzFOQThfNS00SWJLT1hjNlRPdHIzTl9KbWh1b1lkR1dYcTBhZXdfSloyZERTX2ZMV1ZmZXpXZW5qZE95bXRqOGIwSDBPTzdldXBqYS14eWhwWFhUdzUwLWNiRDNvenZXb0F2UWJVMXNnMVJYb2JXeFc2dzl6VEQ4a3VRcTBnUURB?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE83bEJFN3QwcG93Mkh5dDJ4SVdKWFRHZkxTZmtlZ0dHb0N3V1BFTzFBdTB3aGYyRHNVUHVRSm1OZjNwc0swVWFhNFJ0N0JOV3FJLUZzdWVySk9WWEE?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxNbktfdmNYY0kyeWNJa0c2cU03eEtaeHB3d01vNDBySWowVVFUZGlxRzRseEkzQnAxU2M3R2hPVzRoczRHZ3JNczZZR3lUVjljWjBRazhYTnFzU2tXeG1XdzE2N2EtaVNBOE1Uc3F2Vmh6NG1XU1BaSVF4RVJDQjFOUGl5RmZjR0Zad1d2aVNWSmxndWRIRUdxWTE0NWI3dw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Head Topics&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxPTEtWS1ZtOXVuSU8zUFY1aDJSTkVxaWc0dFo3WHNHdlZYUmpybV9NLVluMFV3eXltT0VfMjdCT1JZWjN3aHFWdVltTmJCRnJ1NXhnNHhCZmJHQWE5RmpIV0psNmtnbUdaa3MwY0syY0FRdGdxWG9tMlgwVzNMa2V4RV83U3lDV3AyVXIza2gyX19hTEJBc092dlQxUUQwMGJKdVdoaQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Peoples Gazette Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxPZmRPZDZzc3M0RTNvT0M4LU4tRVhW